  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social reintegration and resilience to combat radicalisation in Northeast Syria &#xbf; Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This third phase will continue addressing the risks and consequences of radicalisation in NES, building on the lesson learned from the previous two phases and considering the latest developments related to re-emergence of ISIS in the area. NPA will maintain its partnership with local NGOssupported within the first and second phases to deepen their capacity to promote resilience of communities and reintegration of families of former ISIS fighters in Ar-Raqqa, Deir Ez-Zor, and Al-Hasakeh (al Hol). These partners are Bahar Organisation (Bahar), Justice for Life (JfL), Shams Organisation (Shams), and Democratic Solutions Organisation (DemoS).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
